# Apple distribution config for WhisPaste (macOS).
#
# Reuses an existing Apple Developer account/Team and App Store Connect API
# key already provisioned for another project of the maintainer's, so no new
# key needs to be generated. Values are loaded from a local, never-committed
# credentials file — see load_local_credentials in Fastfile for the loader
# and ~/.claude/infrastructure/microsoft-partner-center.md-style convention
# this project follows for every external credential (never hardcode an
# identifier that ties back to a real account into a public repo).
#
# app_identifier is the REGISTERED App ID (de.whispaste.app). The macOS Xcode
# project's PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER was migrated to match as of v1.2.58
# (see docs/store-release.md → "Bundle-ID-Migration").
# NOTE: Appfile is loaded by fastlane's CredentialsManager via a bare
# `eval(content)` (no filename argument), so `require_relative` can't infer
# its base path here (unlike in Fastfile, which fastlane loads with a real
# filename). The eval runs inside a `Dir.chdir` into this directory, so a
# plain `require` relative to the current working directory works instead.
require File.join(Dir.pwd, 'load_credentials')

app_identifier("de.whispaste.app")
apple_id(ENV.fetch("FASTLANE_APPLE_ID"))
team_id(ENV.fetch("FASTLANE_TEAM_ID"))
itc_team_id(ENV.fetch("FASTLANE_TEAM_ID"))
